Episode 1
Logline: Nadia is fired in front of the whole office and decides to take the company down.
Continuity: First episode of the series.

INT. BRIGHTWAVE MARKETING - OPEN OFFICE - DAY

Nadia carries a cardboard box of her desk things past rows of silent coworkers.

NADIA
(stunned)
Eleven years. Eleven years and you fire me by calendar invite?

MR. PRUITT
(smug)
It was a restructuring, Nadia. Nothing personal.

NADIA
(furious)
Nothing personal? You gave my accounts to your nephew!

MR. PRUITT
(cool)
Security will walk you out.

DEV
(whispering)
Nadia, wait. Before you go, take this.

Dev presses a small USB drive into her palm and glances at the CEO's glass office.

NADIA
(confused)
What is on it?

DEV
(nervous)
Six months of invoices. Look at the vendor called Halcyon.

MR. PRUITT
(calling)
Dev! My office, now.

DEV
(quiet)
Do not open it here.

Nadia slips the drive into her sleeve as two security guards take her arms.

NADIA
(defiant)
Remember my face, Pruitt. You will see it again.

MR. PRUITT
(laughing)
I doubt it.

The elevator closes. Nadia plugs the drive into her phone and the screen fills with one word: GUILTY.

NADIA
(whispering)
Halcyon is a shell company. And the owner is Pruitt's wife.
